    behaviour touched anywhere. Verified by diffing the added lines and confirming
    none is executable.

    This deliberately crosses protection tiers in one change, which AGENTS.md Hard
    Rule #10 requires confirming first — scope was confirmed before the sweep. The
    files span squad-owned (zimmNavItem.css.ts, zimmButton/index.tsx), Tier 2
    (globalStyles.ts) and Tier 2 designer-owned (header.ts, listMenu.ts), a test
    (theme/index.test.tsx), and two Tier 1 frozen foundation files
    (typography.ts, sizes.ts).

    On the Tier 1 pair: Hard Rule #3's stated rationale is that design-token
    changes go through the UI designer, which a corrected comment path does not
    engage, and foundation/ is not among Hard Rule #4's four absolutes. Edited
    under a verified tier-1-approvers identity per AGENTS.md's Tier 1 Approval
    section. Both diffs are a single comment line each.

    Verified: vitest 252/252 with the theme suites (index.test.tsx collision guards
    and recipeGuards) green at 137/137, tsc clean, build-storybook clean.

